<p>Decimal 36866. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>SCREEN_TEXT_WIDTH</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Number of columns, and part of the screen map address.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bit 7 - bit 9 of the 14 bit screen map address</li>
<li>Bits 6-0 - number of character columns, default is 22</li>
</ul>
